<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Queensland state budget due May 27.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Queensland state budget due May 27.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Queensland state government said it expects to deliver its budget for the 1997/98 financial year (July-June) on Tuesday, May 27.</p>
<p>&quot;We are working toward bringing in a balanced Budget for Queensland which I look forward to delivering on May 27,&quot; deputy premier and state treasurer, Joan Sheldon told an Australian Society of Corporate Treasurers' meeting.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
